  accept 89 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Its pikes and rivets come from the gnolls north of the lake, on the loop after Westfall
  turnin 127 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Dockmaster Baren
  turnin 130 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Martie Jainrose
  accept 131 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf
  turnin 131 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Darcy, inside

step Dockmaster Baren
  when level>=20
  tip From level 20 Dockmaster Baren gives Murloc Poachers: take it now if he offers it (otherwise on the last Lakeshire stop). Its murlocs are for your next Redridge visit, at about 24.
  accept 150 optional only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Dockmaster Baren, on the docks

step Fly to Stormwind
  zone Redridge Mountains
  goto 30.4,59.0 "Lakeshire flight master"
  fly "Stormwind"
  zone Stormwind City

step Stormwind's gate
  when !turnedin 65
  zone Stormwind City
  tip No Defias Brotherhood from Wiley (it starts with Gryan Stoutmantle's letter in Westfall): skip Westfall. North along the road from Goldshire to Stormwind: General Marcus Jonathan sits on his horse at the far end of the bridge outside the main gate. Then the gryphons in the Trade District, back to Lakeshire.
  turnin 120 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- General Marcus Jonathan, outside the main gate
  accept 121 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf
  fly "Lakeshire"

step To Class trainer
  zone Elwynn Forest
  goto 43.6,65.1 "To Class trainer"

step Class trainer
  only Paladin,Hunter,Priest,Warlock
  train class only Paladin,Hunter,Priest,Warlock

step Warrior trainer
  only Warrior
  train class only Warrior -- Seena Skybreaker in Zephras Isle; Goldshire has no warrior trainer

step Rogue trainer
  only Rogue
  train class only Rogue -- Eltheen Nightbreeze in Zephras Isle; Goldshire has no rogue trainer

step Mage trainer
  only Mage
  train class only Mage -- Anathamaas Aetherwind in Zephras Isle; Goldshire has no mage trainer

step Druid trainer
  only Druid
  train class only Druid -- Alfina Nightgaze in Alterac Mountains; Goldshire has no druid trainer

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Westfall

step Goldshire
  zone Elwynn Forest
  tip West out of Redridge by Three Corners and along the road through Elwynn to Goldshire.
  goto 42.1,65.9 "Goldshire"

step Smith Argus
  zone Elwynn Forest
  tip Smith Argus works at the Goldshire smithy.
  turnin 118 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Smith Argus, inside
  accept 119 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf

step Westfall
  zone Westfall
  goto 56.3,47.5 "Westfall"

step Sentinel Hill
  when turnedin 65
  zone Westfall
  tip Down the road to Sentinel Hill. Gryan Stoutmantle stands at the top of the stone tower.
  turnin 132 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Gryan Stoutmantle
  accept 135 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- For Master Mathias Shaw in Stormwind
  accept 14 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Gryan Stoutmantle
  accept 92747                                -- Alba Fairmoon

step Fly to Stormwind
  when turnedin 65
  zone Westfall
  goto 56.6,52.6 "Sentinel Hill flight master"

step Fly to Stormwind
  zone Westfall
  goto 56.6,52.7 "Sentinel Hill flight master"
  fly "Stormwind"
  zone Stormwind City

step Stormwind
  when turnedin 65
  zone Stormwind City
  tip Master Mathias Shaw is upstairs in the SI:7 building in Old Town: the stairs are hard to see at first. General Marcus Jonathan sits on his horse at the far end of the bridge outside the main gate, then back to the gryphons in the Trade District.
  turnin 135 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Master Mathias Shaw, SI:7; upstairs
  accept 141 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf
  fly "Sentinel Hill"

step Sentinel Hill
  when turnedin 65
  zone Westfall
  turnin 141 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Gryan Stoutmantle, at the top of the tower
  accept 142 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf

step Moonbrook and the Defias hills
  when turnedin 65
  tip Defias Pathstalkers and Knuckledusters walk Moonbrook; Highwaymen (level 17) patrol the hills south and east of it in pairs: pull them apart. The Deadmines entrance in the smithy is a group dungeon.
  tip Careful: The camps in the hills hold mixed groups of Defias, so it is easy to pull more than one at a time if you are low level.
  kill 122 quest 14 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf
  kill 449 quest 14 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf
  kill 121 quest 14 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf
  collect 254676 quest 92747.1                -- Suspicious Industrial Supplies, from the crates around Moonbrook

step The Defias Messenger
  when turnedin 65
  tip South along the road to Moonbrook. The Defias Messenger starts in front of the Moonbrook smithy and walks north to the Gold Coast Quarry and the back of the Jangolode Mine, then back: look along his road. Slow him when he runs at 30% health.
  collect 1381 quest 142 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- A Mysterious Message: the Defias Messenger

step Half Pendant of Aquatic Endurance
  only NightElf,Skyborne,Druid
  when turnedin 65
  when onquest 272
  zone Westfall
  tip Druids on Trial of the Sea Lion: from the Gold Coast Quarry, west to the shore and north along it. The Strange Lockbox lies on the sea floor off the coast (about 18,33); then back south along the coast to the lighthouse.
  collect 15882 x1                            -- Half Pendant of Aquatic Endurance: the Strange Lockbox

step Westfall Lighthouse
  zone Westfall
  when turnedin 65
  tip South-west from Moonbrook to the lighthouse on the point: Captain Grayson waits on its steps. Old Murk-Eye walks the beach and the shallows north-east of it among the murlocs: pull him away from the Oracles.
  accept 104 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Captain Grayson

step Captain Grayson
  when turnedin 65
  when has 814 x5
  tip Kept five Flasks of Oil from Westfall's Harvest Watchers? Captain Grayson takes them for his lighthouse fire.
  accept 103 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Captain Grayson

step Westfall Lighthouse
  when turnedin 65
  collect 3636 quest 104 @33.7,83.9 map 1436 live only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Scale of Old Murk-Eye: Old Murk-Eye, on the beach north-east of the lighthouse
  turnin 104 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Captain Grayson

step Captain Grayson
  when turnedin 65
  when has 814 x5
  turnin 103 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf

step Sentinel Hill
  when turnedin 65
  tip Back north up the road to Sentinel Hill. The Defias Traitor waits at the foot of the tower ramp; if he is missing, someone is escorting him and he is back within minutes.
  turnin 142 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Gryan Stoutmantle
  turnin 14 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf
  turnin 92747                                -- Alba Fairmoon
  accept 155 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- The Defias Traitor

step The Defias Traitor
  when turnedin 65
  tip Stay with the traitor as he walks south to Moonbrook; he does not stop for fights, so clear what follows him. His walk ends at the Defias hideout below Moonbrook.
  goto 38.0,77.5
  complete 155 @55.7,47.5 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- The Defias Traitor, at the foot of the tower ramp

step Sentinel Hill
  when turnedin 65
  tip Back north to Gryan Stoutmantle and the gryphons.
  turnin 155 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Gryan Stoutmantle
  fly "Lakeshire"

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- North of the lake

step Lakeshire
  zone Redridge Mountains
  tip From the gryphons, over the bridge into town: Verner Osgood by the smithy, Magistrate Solomon in the town hall.
  turnin 119 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Verner Osgood
  accept 122 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf
  accept 124 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf
  turnin 121 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Magistrate Solomon, in the town hall

step Redridge Canyons: kill these as you meet them
  zone Redridge Mountains
  tip Redridge Brutes and Mystics hold the hills north and north-west of town; both carry the Iron Pikes and Rivets. Black Dragon Whelps nest in the same hills.
  tip Careful: The whelps cast Fireball from range, and the gnolls run for help at low health.
  kill 426 quest 124 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Redridge Brute
  collect 1013 quest 89 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Iron Rivet
  collect 2856 quest 89 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Iron Pike
  kill 430 quest 124 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Redridge Mystic
  collect 1221 quest 122 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Underbelly Whelp Scale: Black Dragon Whelps

step Lakeshire
  tip Back down into town: Verner Osgood by the smithy, Foreman Oslow at the north end of the bridge, Dockmaster Baren on the docks.
  turnin 124 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Verner Osgood
  turnin 122 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf
  turnin 89 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Foreman Oslow

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Back to Darkshore

step Fly to Stormwind
  when !zone "Darkshore"
  zone Redridge Mountains
  tip Back to Auberdine for Darkshore's southern loops: the gryphon to Stormwind, then the boat from the harbour. Hearthstone ready (bound in Auberdine since the first Darkshore visit)? Use it instead: these steps drop once you are in Darkshore.
  goto 25.5,59.4 "Lakeshire flight master" live

step Baros Alexston
  when onquest 97914
  when !zone "Darkshore"
  zone Stormwind City
  tip Baros Alexston stands at the east side of Cathedral Square, on the way from the Dwarven District to the harbour.
  turnin 97914 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Baros Alexston: Thundris' letter from Auberdine
  accept 97926 optional only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- For Thundris Windweaver, where the boat lands

step Gazin Tenorm
  only Human,Paladin
  zone Stormwind City
  when onquest 1787,1788
  when !zone "Darkshore"
  tip Gazin Tenorm and Duthorian Rall are in the Cathedral of Light, on Cathedral Square, on the way to the harbour.
  goto 50.5,47.5 "Cathedral of Light" live
  turnin 1787 only Human -- Gazin Tenorm
  accept 1788 only Human
  turnin 1788 only Human -- Duthorian Rall: Redemption

step Class trainer
  only Warrior,Paladin,Hunter,Rogue,Priest,Mage,Warlock
  when !zone "Darkshore"
  zone Stormwind City
  tip Train on the way to the harbour: Old Town (Warriors, Rogues), the Cathedral of Light (Paladins, Priests), the Mage Quarter (Mages, Warlocks), the Dwarven District (Hunters).
  train class only Warrior,Paladin,Hunter,Rogue,Priest,Mage,Warlock
